  "description": "Headless WebKitGTK-based HTML to PDF renderer for .NET. Drop-in API-compatible with CobaltPDF (the Chromium-based one) - same C# API, same fluent methods, same CobaltEngine type. A lightweight, self-contained Linux engine with lower idle memory than Chromium (it releases memory between renders); Chromium remains the faster engine. On managed Linux hosts (Azure App Service / Functions / Container Apps, AKS, ECS) the library auto-provisions a portable WebKit bundle on first use - no system setup. For plain Docker, use an Ubuntu 24.04 base with the webkit2gtk runtime (see the Docker guide at cobaltpdf.com/guides/docker).",
